## SAGA exit criteria

S03-001 may establish the packet baseline used by later runtime work. SAGA-03 completes only when S03-002 also verifies GTOC-7 preservation and terminalization for finite migration bundles and both sprints are human promoted; this re-entry does not add a cyclic SAGA prerequisite.

## Surviving obstructions

* SAGA-01 is not promoted.
* Canonical work-packet schema and packet bundle closure are incomplete.
* Host lease and successor-budget admission are unverified.

* GTOC-7/S03-002 is blocked on the packet baseline and GTOC-6.
